WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
What we are carrying today is not a waste of food.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,000
It's about carrying all these things up there.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,800
The fourth floor is being renovated.

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,200
Bring everything up for me

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,400
No time limit

6
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,200
But it's best to move it before tomorrow

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,000
This way we can work well and rest assured

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,200
Are you still in charge of the food? Of course, you are in charge of the food.

9
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,000
Just work here with peace of mind and I'll take care of your food.

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,600
I'll have the takeaway delivered to you by then, Brother Ma.

11
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,000
He has to eat at least three servings by himself. Three servings is three servings.

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,400
If you are so good at what you do, I'm willing to pay you, so that's it. If you move, I'll leave first.

13
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:31,220
Finally finished moving

14
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:34,760
Give Brother Ma a call first. Brother Ma, please come and inspect the goods.

15
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:39,880
The money has arrived, Brother Xiao

16
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:40,880
Let's go to the store and change some cash.

17
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:47,180
By the way, I bought two bottles of water. Brother Xiao, it’s three thousand yuan. You take it and I’ll take a quarter.

18
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:48,380
You take three quarters

19
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:49,780
I made twenty-three thousand two hundred today

20
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:50,780
Rice that can buy more than 10,000 gold

21
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:52,980
This guy is so handsome

22
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,380
So manly

23
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:58,980
Are you helping to move things on the fourth floor? Yes, it’s done. It’s done. Yes, it’s all moved.
